This project contains test fixtures copied from other projects.

tests/fixtures/anova_frames.csv
    A verbatim copy of pkg/wifi/testdata/test_data.csv from Anova4All
    (https://github.com/AlmogBaku/Anova4All), MIT licensed,
    copyright (c) Almog Baku. It contains 115 frames captured from a real
    cooker and its server, used here to verify the frame codec.

Protocol knowledge was cross-checked against:

- Anova4All, MIT, https://github.com/AlmogBaku/Anova4All
- "Hacking My Sous Vide" and its protocol notes by TheUbuntuGuy,
  https://gist.github.com/TheUbuntuGuy/225492a8dec816d49b70d9c21811e8b1
- The BLE command set extracted from the Anova Android app v2.1.0 by
  dfrankland/sous-vide, https://github.com/dfrankland/sous-vide

